# 进阶动画与视觉编排

## 核心概念

SwiftUI 的动画系统在 iOS 17/18 经历了范式升级：从早期的隐式/显式动画二分法，演进到 PhaseAnimator（相位动画）和 KeyframeAnimator（关键帧动画）两大声明式编排工具。加上 matchedGeometryEffect 的跨容器过渡和 CustomAnimation 协议的自定义插值器，开发者可以构建电影级视觉叙事而无需掉入 Core Animation 的命令式深渊。

```mermaid
flowchart LR
    subgraph 基础层
        A[withAnimation] --> B[隐式动画 .animation modifier]
    end
    subgraph 编排层
        C[PhaseAnimator] --> D[多阶段循环/触发]
        E[KeyframeAnimator] --> F[多属性独立时间线]
    end
    subgraph 过渡层
        G[matchedGeometryEffect] --> H[跨容器几何插值]
        I[.transition] --> J[进出场动画]
    end
    subgraph 自定义层
        K[CustomAnimation Protocol] --> L[自定义弹簧/阻尼曲线]
    end
```

| 动画类型              | 适用场景                       | API                                |
| --------------------- | ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------- |
| 隐式动画              | 单属性状态切换                 | `.animation(.spring, value:)`      |
| 显式动画              | 多属性同步变化                 | `withAnimation(.easeInOut) { }`    |
| PhaseAnimator         | 多阶段循环（脉冲、加载指示器） | `PhaseAnimator([phases])`          |
| KeyframeAnimator      | 多属性各有独立时间线的复杂编排 | `KeyframeAnimator(initialValue:)`  |
| matchedGeometryEffect | Hero 过渡、跨容器形变          | `.matchedGeometryEffect(id:in:)`   |
| Transaction           | 局部覆盖动画参数               | `withTransaction` / `.transaction` |

## PhaseAnimator 相位动画

PhaseAnimator 将动画建模为有限状态机——定义若干相位（phase），SwiftUI 依次在相位间插值。非常适合循环动画：

```swift
struct PulsingDot: View {
    var body: some View {
        Circle()
            .frame(width: 20, height: 20)
            .phaseAnimator([false, true]) { content, phase in
                content
                    .scaleEffect(phase ? 1.6 : 1.0)
                    .opacity(phase ? 0.3 : 1.0)
            } animation: { phase in
                phase ? .easeOut(duration: 0.8) : .easeIn(duration: 0.6)
            }
    }
}
```

带触发器的非循环相位动画：

```swift
enum SubmitPhase: CaseIterable {
    case idle, pressing, success
}

struct SubmitButton: View {
    @State private var trigger = false

    var body: some View {
        Button("提交") { trigger.toggle() }
            .phaseAnimator(SubmitPhase.allCases, trigger: trigger) { content, phase in
                content
                    .scaleEffect(phase == .pressing ? 0.9 : 1.0)
                    .foregroundStyle(phase == .success ? .green : .blue)
            } animation: { phase in
                switch phase {
                case .idle: .bouncy
                case .pressing: .easeIn(duration: 0.1)
                case .success: .spring(duration: 0.4, bounce: 0.3)
                }
            }
    }
}
```

## KeyframeAnimator 关键帧动画

当多个属性需要沿各自独立的时间线变化时，使用 KeyframeAnimator：

```swift
struct AnimationValues {
    var scale: CGFloat = 1.0
    var rotation: Angle = .zero
    var yOffset: CGFloat = 0
}

struct BouncingLogo: View {
    @State private var trigger = false

    var body: some View {
        Image(systemName: "star.fill")
            .font(.system(size: 60))
            .keyframeAnimator(initialValue: AnimationValues(), trigger: trigger) { content, value in
                content
                    .scaleEffect(value.scale)
                    .rotationEffect(value.rotation)
                    .offset(y: value.yOffset)
            } keyframes: { _ in
                KeyframeTrack(\.scale) {
                    SpringKeyframe(1.5, duration: 0.3, spring: .bouncy)
                    SpringKeyframe(1.0, duration: 0.2, spring: .bouncy)
                }
                KeyframeTrack(\.rotation) {
                    LinearKeyframe(.degrees(0), duration: 0.1)
                    SpringKeyframe(.degrees(360), duration: 0.5, spring: .smooth)
                }
                KeyframeTrack(\.yOffset) {
                    CubicKeyframe(-30, duration: 0.2)
                    CubicKeyframe(0, duration: 0.3)
                }
            }
            .onTapGesture { trigger.toggle() }
    }
}
```

## matchedGeometryEffect Hero 过渡

跨容器的几何形变动画（常见于列表-详情 Hero 过渡）：

```swift
struct PhotoGrid: View {
    @Namespace private var heroNamespace
    @State private var selectedPhoto: Photo?

    var body: some View {
        ZStack {
            ScrollView {
                LazyVGrid(columns: [GridItem(.adaptive(minimum: 100))]) {
                    ForEach(photos) { photo in
                        if selectedPhoto?.id != photo.id {
                            PhotoThumbnail(photo: photo)
                                .matchedGeometryEffect(id: photo.id, in: heroNamespace)
                                .onTapGesture {
                                    withAnimation(.spring(duration: 0.4, bounce: 0.2)) {
                                        selectedPhoto = photo
                                    }
                                }
                        }
                    }
                }
            }

            if let photo = selectedPhoto {
                PhotoDetail(photo: photo)
                    .matchedGeometryEffect(id: photo.id, in: heroNamespace)
                    .onTapGesture {
                        withAnimation(.spring(duration: 0.4, bounce: 0.2)) {
                            selectedPhoto = nil
                        }
                    }
            }
        }
    }
}
```

## 自定义 Transition

封装可复用的进出场动画：

```swift
struct SlideAndFade: Transition {
    func body(content: Content, phase: TransitionPhase) -> some View {
        content
            .opacity(phase.isIdentity ? 1 : 0)
            .offset(y: phase == .willAppear ? 30 : (phase == .didDisappear ? -30 : 0))
            .scaleEffect(phase.isIdentity ? 1 : 0.8)
    }
}

extension AnyTransition {
    static var slideAndFade: AnyTransition {
        .modifier(active: SlideAndFade(), identity: SlideAndFade())
    }
}
```

## Transaction 细粒度控制

在需要局部覆盖动画行为时使用 Transaction：

```swift
// 禁用某个子树的动画
withTransaction(\.disableAnimations, true) {
    state.reset()
}

// Modifier 级别覆盖
Text("Score: \(score)")
    .transaction { transaction in
        transaction.animation = score > 100 ? .bouncy : nil
    }
```

## 小结

- PhaseAnimator 将循环/多阶段动画建模为状态机，代码量远低于 CAKeyframeAnimation
- KeyframeAnimator 让多属性沿独立时间线编排，实现复杂的视觉叙事
- matchedGeometryEffect 解决跨容器 Hero 过渡，核心是 Namespace 共享 identity
- 自定义 Transition 配合 TransitionPhase 枚举实现进出场差异化
- Transaction 提供子树/局部动画覆盖能力，避免全局 withAnimation 的副作用蔓延

